\"tokens\": 1550217,\n752\t        \"costUsd\": 1.05,\n753\t        \"tools\": \"Bash 12, Write 1\"\n754\t      }\n755\t    ],\n756\t    \"costBasis\": \"reported\"\n757\t  },\n758\t  \"caveats\": [\n759\t    \"No importer: the run director retypes six numbers and the milestones line each week, and counts is JSON. The V prefix for volunteer clubs is this card's extension of the runstats line.\",\n760\t    \"From six clubs the badges get smaller (two rows, or one long row on a wide card). Eight or more clubs are refused on a 480x270 thumbnail.\",\n761\t    \"No parkrun marks by design, so at defaults it looks like any 5k's weekly summary. The PowerPoint originals it replaces were described to us, not seen.\"\n762\t  ]\n763\t};\n764\t\n765\texport const WeeklyRunReportV1 = defineMosaicTemplate<WeeklyRunReportProps>({\n766\t  id: asTemplateId(ID),\n767\t  label: \"2026-10-06 · Weekly 5k Run Report\",\n768\t  version: 1,\n769\t  description: \"The weekly results card a volunteer-run Saturday 5k posts after every run: event, run number and date, finishers and volunteers as the two headline numbers, new PBs, first timers, visitors and first-time volunteers under them, and the milestone clubs reached. Numbers are typed in, never fetched.\",\n770\t  capabilities: { tier: \"core\" },\n771\t  tags: [\"community\",\"2026-10-06\",\"day-017\", \"running\", \"5k\", \"volunteers\", \"weekly\", \"stats\", \"results\"],\n772\t\n773\t  outputHints: {\n774\t    width: 1080,\n775\t    height: 1080,\n776\t    fps: 30,\n777\t    durationMs: 2000,\n778\t    format: { kind: \"image\", container: \"png\" },\n779\t    note: \"Still PNG, one card per event per week. 1080x1080 for the feed; 1080x1920 (story) and 1920x1080 (results page) reflow the tiles. Eight or more milestone clubs are refused at 480x270.\",\n780\t  },\n781\t\n782\t  propsSchema,\n783\t  defaultProps: DEFAULTS,\n784\t\n785\t  render,\n786\t  renderTutorial: whyTutorial(WHY, render),\n787\t});\n788\t\n789\texport default Week