{"type":"system","subtype":"task_notification","task_id":"aa701a91ac944af30","tool_use_id":"toolu_01UpYARovqyAKkWrc35AQEVm","status":"completed","output_file":"C:\\Users\\MAINDE~1\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\claude\\C--src-m0saic-production-one-a-day\\b12b7f98-286e-4a2c-8ef9-9c2a336f1aee\\tasks\\aa701a91ac944af30.output","summary":"I checked all four items against dist (built 13:42, after the source edit at 13:39). Items 1–3 pass; item 4 fails because the \"eight or more\" copy is wrong for longer captions. I ran 316 settleLayout calls in total (about 15 ms each), slightly over the ~300 you allowed. Everything I wrote is under `journal/2026-10-06/scratch/verify/`.\n\n**1. Milestone clubs on mid-size canvases: PASS**\n- **Canvases:** aspects 9:16, 3:4, 1:1, 16:9 and 21:9, each at widths 640, 1080, 1920 and 3840. Plus 1000x800, 1200x900, 1290x1000, 1440x900, 828x1792, 1125x2436, 1001x1001 and 480x270.\n- **Inputs:** the base list for n=1..10. The longer-caption list (\"15xV25, 13xV50\" replacing the volunteer counts) at n=10 on every canvas, plus a few thumbnail cases.\n- **Refusals with min(H, 0.75W) >= 300:** none. All four previously failing canvases now accept n=6..10. 1000x800 uses 20px club numbers and 11px captions in 2 rows; 1200x900, 1290x1000 and 1440x900 behave the same way.\n- **Every refusal I saw (all on canvases below 300):**\n  - 480x270 (270): base list n=8, 9, 10; long list n=7.\n  - 640x274 (274): long list n=10.\n  - All of these give \"milestones cannot be fitted on WxH above the 6px readability floor\".\n- **Monotonicity:** no case where a larger canvas of the same aspect refuses what a smaller one accepts. I also found no case where a canvas both wider and taller refuses what a smaller one accepts, across all canvases.\n\n**2. counts as a JSON string: PASS**\n- **Same result:** `normalizeWeeklyRunReport` gives a deep-equal result for the object, its JSON string and a pretty-printed string. `settleLayout` at 1080x1080 is deep-equal for the object and the string.\n- **Bad JSON:** `{finishers: 214`, `{\"finishers\":214,`, an empty string and `not json` all give \"counts is not valid JSON: ...\".\n- **Valid JSON that is not an object:** `null`, `[1,2,3]`, `\"hello\"` and `42` give \"counts must be an object ...\".\n- **Bad contents:** a missing key, an unknown key (`dnf`) and `\"38\"` as a string are each refused with a message naming counts or the specific key.\n\n**3. Badge sizes and text fit: PASS**\n- **Club vs stat numbers:** across every accepted layout, the club number size (`badgePx`) is never larger than `statPx`. The highest ratio is exactly 1.000: they tie on wide canvases for n≤5 (e.g. 1920x1080 at 68/68, 1440x900 at 59/59) and on the 640x274 and 480x270 thumbnails.\n- **Text fit:** for every badge, ceil(club px × 1.22) + ceil(caption px × 1.22) fits the badge height. Both text cells lie inside the badge, the drawn width is within each cell's width budget, and each badge lies inside the band. No badges overlap.\n\n**4. WHY.caveats and outputHints.note: FAIL**\n- **What holds:** with the base list, 480x270 accepts n≤7 and refuses n=8..10, which matches \"Eight or more clubs are refused on a 480x270 thumbnail\".\n- **Where it is wrong:**\n  - At 480x270, `\"6xR25, 4xR50, 3xR100, 2xR250, 1xR500, 1xR1000, 15xV25\"` (7 clubs) is refused, so \"eight or more\" is false once a caption has a two-digit volunteer count.\n  - At 640x274, the 10-club long-caption list is refused, so refusals are not limited to 480x270.\n- **Minor caveat wording:**\n  - \"From six clubs the badges get smaller\" is false on 640x274 and 480x270. Both keep a 16px club number and a 45x45 or 48x48 badge from n=5 to n=6. It holds on the other 26 canvases.\n  - \"Or one long row on a wide card\" only happened on 640x274 (n=6..10) and 480x270 (n=6..7). Every other wide canvas, including 640x360, 1080x463, 1200x900 and 1440x900, used two rows.\n\nScripts and raw results are in `C:\\src\\m0saic-production\\one-a-day\\journal\\2026-10-06\\scratch\\verify\\`: `sweep.cjs`, `sweep.json`, `summary.cjs`, `extra.cjs` and `time.cjs`.","usage":{"total_tokens":67986,"tool_uses":9,"duration_ms":157269},"uuid":"17c00c5b-2dde-499a-a8a3-f93d19e0d93c","session_id":"b12b7f98-286e-4a2c-8ef9-9c2a336f1aee"}
